## To native args () -> Seq of Text
## To native parseInt (s: Text) -> Int

## To countUp (n: Int, salt: Int) -> Int:
    Let mutable c be 0.
    Repeat for i from 1 to n:
        Set c to c + (i * salt) % 7.
    Return c.

## Main
Let n be parseInt(item 2 of args()).
Simultaneously:
    Let a be countUp(n, 1).
    Let b be countUp(n, 2).
    Let c be countUp(n, 3).
    Let d be countUp(n, 4).
Show a.
Show b.
Show c.
Show d.
